 </span><span begin="01:37.730" end="01:38.090">them </span><span begin="01:38.090" end="01:39.470">done</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.950" end="01:43.190"><span begin="01:39.950" end="01:40.250">I </span><span begin="01:40.250" end="01:40.610">know </span><span begin="01:40.610" end="01:41.450">tomorrow </span><span begin="01:41.450" end="01:42.170">brings </span><span begin="01:42.170" end="01:42.320">the </span><span begin="01:42.320" end="01:43.190">consequence</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.190" end="01:44.540"><span begin="01:43.190" end="01:43.340">At </span><span begin="01:43.340" end="01:44.540">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.810" end="01:47.300"><span begin="01:44.810" end="01:45.110">But </span><span begin="01:45.110" end="01:45.260">I </span><span begin="01:45.260" end="01:45.590">keep </span><span begin="01:45.590" end="01:46.160">livin' </span><span begin="01:46.160" end="01:46.490">this </span><span begin="01:46.490" end="01:46.910">day </span><span begin="01:46.910" end="01:47.300">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.300" end="01:49.430"><span begin="01:47.300" end="01:47.540">The </span><span begin="01:47.540" end="01:47.990">next </span><span begin="01:47.990" end="01:48.290">will </span><span begin="01:48.290" end="01:48.710">never </span><span begin="01:48.710" end="01:49.430">come</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.460" end="01:52.160"><span begin="01:49.460" end="01:50.210">Oh </span><span begin="01:50.210" end="01:50.630">help </span><span begin="01:50.630" end="01:50.930">me </span><span begin="01:50.930" end="01:51.290">but </span><span begin="01:51.290" end="01:51.620">don't </span><span begin="01:51.620" end="01:51.980">tell </span><span begin="01:51.980" end="01:52.160">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.160" end="01:54.140"><span begin="01:52.160" end="01:52.430">To </span><span begin="01:52.430" end="01:53.330">deny </span><span begin="01:53.330" end="01:54.140">it</span></p><